# 行尾与文本规则：仓库统一 LF，Windows 检出按需转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换，也不参与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary

# 明确文本类型（便于 GitHub 语言统计与 diff）
*.java text
*.kts text
*.gradle text
*.properties text
*.xml text
*.htm text
*.js text
*.css text
*.svg text
*.md text

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 goto/label 解析会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
